{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/203301-odd-inspirations","id":203301,"title":"Odd inspirations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-20T16:45:06-07:00","id":203301,"title":"Odd inspirations","content":"Has anyone came across something that was surprisingly good fodder for ideas. For me, the show, 1000 Ways to Die has a good amount of inspiration for W:TO. (<a href=\"http://www.spike.com/shows/1000-ways-to-die\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.spike.com/shows/1000-ways-to-die</a>) Since a number of the victims probably died with passions and unfinished goals, it wouldn't be surprising if they did become Wraiths. Like the guy in &quot;Trailer Trashed&quot; who didn't get to travel with his new wife due to accidentally mixing chemicals that suffocates him.<br /> <br /> So what about you guys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T23:28:34-07:00","id":203570,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Along the same lines, <i>Dr. G: Medical Examiner</i>.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_